OL,3,GNEWSATunnelling starts on delayed #800m
OL,4,Areservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on pipelines to serve
OL,7,Fthe UK's first major new reservoir in
OL,8,Fdecades - after the project's estimated
OL,9,Fcost more than doubled to over #800m.
OL,11,FHavant Thicket Reservoir in Hampshire
OL,12,Fis now not expected to be completed
OL,13,Funtil 2034, later than originally
OL,14,Fplanned.
OL,16,FPortsmouth Water, which is building the
OL,17,Freservoir, said the rise was partly
OL,18,Fdown to an extra pipeline added to
OL,19,F"future-proof" the project, as well as
OL,20,Funexpected ground conditions beneath
OL,21,Fthe site.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
