OL,3,GNEWSATunnelling starts on delayed #800m
OL,4,Areservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe additional pipeline would serve a
OL,7,Fproposed water recycling scheme, which
OL,8,Fcould see treated sewage piped into the
OL,9,Freservoir and has proved controversial
OL,10,Fwith campaigners.
